CLASS_MAGE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mage:30:30|t  |cFF40C7EBMage|r\nMages are the iconic magic-users of Azeroth and learn their craft through intense research and study. They make up for their light armor with a potent array of offensive and defensive spells. Their primary stats are Spell Power and Intellect.";
CLASS_MAGE_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mage:30:30|t  |cFF40C7EBMage|r\nMages are the iconic magic-users of Azeroth and learn their craft through intense research and study. They make up for their light armor with a potent array of offensive and defensive spells. Their primary stats are Spell Power and Intellect.";
CLASS_BLOODMAGE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_blood_battle_mage_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffeb0000Blood Battle Mage|r\nBlood battle mages tap into their own vitality and bend it to their advantage, using it to cripple their enemies, empower themselves, and fuel their spells. As a blood battle mage, you learn to master the life force within you and bend it to your will.";
CLASS_BLOODMAGE_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_blood_battle_mage_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffeb0000Blood Battle Mage|r\nBlood battle mages tap into their own vitality and bend it to their advantage, using it to cripple their enemies, empower themselves, and fuel their spells. As a blood battle mage, you learn to master the life force within you and bend it to your will.";
CLASS_PALADIN = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_paladin:30:30|t  |cFFF58CBAPaladin|r\nPaladins are heavily-armored fighters and defenders who use Holy magic to heal wounds and combat evil. Paladins are relatively self-sufficient and have many abilities targeted at death prevention. They can focus on two-handed weapons, shields or healing. Their primary stats depend on their role.";
CLASS_PALADIN_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_paladin:30:30|t  |cFFF58CBAPaladin|r\nPaladins are heavily-armored fighters and defenders who use Holy magic to heal wounds and combat evil. Paladins are relatively self-sufficient and have many abilities targeted at death prevention. They can focus on two-handed weapons, shields or healing. Their primary stats depend on their role.";
CLASS_PRIEST = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_priest:30:30|t  |cffffffffPriest|r\nPriests are well-rounded healers with a variety of tools. However, they can also sacrifice their healing to deal damage with Shadow magic. Within society, priests act as the spiritual leaders of their respective races. The priest's primary stats are Spell Power, Intellect, and Spirit if healing.";
CLASS_PRIEST_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_priest:30:30|t  |cffffffffPriest|r\nPriests are well-rounded healers with a variety of tools. However, they can also sacrifice their healing to deal damage with Shadow magic. Within society, priests act as the spiritual leaders of their respective races. The priest's primary stats are Spell Power, Intellect, and Spirit if healing.";
CLASS_ROGUE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_rogue:30:30|t  |cFFFFF569Rogue|r\nRogues often serve as assassins or scouts, though many are lone wolves as well. Rogues specialize in dual-wielding a variety of weapons, though the iconic rogue weapon is the dagger.|n|nRogues can often sneak around enemies or attack an opponent from behind to try and finish them off quickly. Their primary stats are Attack Power and Agility.";
CLASS_ROGUE_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_rogue:30:30|t  |cFFFFF569Rogue|r\nRogues often serve as assassins or scouts, though many are lone wolves as well. Rogues specialize in dual-wielding a variety of weapons, though the iconic rogue weapon is the dagger.|n|nRogues can often sneak around enemies or attack an opponent from behind to try and finish them off quickly. Their primary stats are Attack Power and Agility.";
CLASS_SHAMAN = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_shaman:30:30|t  |cFF0070DEShaman|r\nShaman use the power of the elements to enhance their weapon damage or spells. Shaman summon totems in combat, small objects that buff, heal or cause damage to enemies. Shaman often act as spiritual leaders in tribal communities. Their primary stats depend on their role.";
CLASS_SHAMAN_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_shaman:30:30|t  |cFF0070DEShaman|r\nShaman use the power of the elements to enhance their weapon damage or spells. Shaman summon totems in combat, small objects that buff, heal or cause damage to enemies. Shaman often act as spiritual leaders in tribal communities. Their primary stats depend on their role.";
CLASS_WARLOCK = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_warlock:30:30|t  |cFF8787EDWarlock|r\nWarlocks deal Fire or Shadow magic to damage, drain or curse their enemy. They can drain souls to power their spells. Warlocks can convert their health into mana or summon group members to their locations.|n|nWarlocks are feared in some Alliance societies while considered great leaders in some Horde societies. As casters, the warlock's primary stats are Spell Power and Intellect.";
CLASS_WARLOCK_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_warlock:30:30|t  |cFF8787EDWarlock|r\nWarlocks deal Fire or Shadow magic to damage, drain or curse their enemy. They can drain souls to power their spells. Warlocks can convert their health into mana or summon group members to their locations.|n|nWarlocks are feared in some Alliance societies while considered great leaders in some Horde societies. As casters, the warlock's primary stats are Spell Power and Intellect.";
CLASS_WARRIOR = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_warrior:30:30|t  |cFFC79C6EWarrior|r\nWarriors are plate-wearing fighters who strive for perfection in armed combat. As warriors deal or take damage, they generate rage, which is used to power their special attacks.|n|nWarriors can choose to focus on a two-handed weapon, dual-wielding or using a sword and shield. Warriors have several abilities that let them move quickly around the battlefield. Their primary stat is Strength, though tanking warriors desire Stamina as well.";
CLASS_WARRIOR_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_warrior:30:30|t  |cFFC79C6EWarrior|r\nWarriors are plate-wearing fighters who strive for perfection in armed combat. As warriors deal or take damage, they generate rage, which is used to power their special attacks.|n|nWarriors can choose to focus on a two-handed weapon, dual-wielding or using a sword and shield. Warriors have several abilities that let them move quickly around the battlefield. Their primary stat is Strength, though tanking warriors desire Stamina as well.";
CLASS_GEOMANCER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffc4e96cGeomancer|r\nGeomancers share a connection with one or more types of physical terrain. While standing on such terrain, they can draw on the energy of that place to empower their spells.";
CLASS_GEOMANCER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffc4e96cGeomancer|r\nGeomancers share a connection with one or more types of physical terrain. While standing on such terrain, they can draw on the energy of that place to empower their spells.";
CLASS_DEMONHUNTER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_demonhunter:30:30|t  |cffa330c9Demon Hunter|r\nDisciples of Illidan Stormrage, demon hunters carry a sinister legacy that terrifies their allies as much as their enemies. Convinced it is essential to standing against the Legion, the Illidari devote themselves to a chaotic and corrupted magic, an energy that has threatened the world of Azeroth for a very long time. They claim the power of the demons they have slaughtered and eventually take on the very forms of their enemies, drawing disgust and dread from their fellow elves.";
CLASS_DEMONHUNTER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_demonhunter:30:30|t  |cffa330c9Demon Hunter|r\nDisciples of Illidan Stormrage, demon hunters carry a sinister legacy that terrifies their allies as much as their enemies. Convinced it is essential to standing against the Legion, the Illidari devote themselves to a chaotic and corrupted magic, an energy that has threatened the world of Azeroth for a very long time. They claim the power of the demons they have slaughtered and eventually take on the very forms of their enemies, drawing disgust and dread from their fellow elves.";
CLASS_MONK = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_monk:30:30|t  |cff00ff96Monk|r\nMonks of ancient Pandaria developed their martial arts as a means of resistance against their former masters. Now that the other peoples of Azeroth have rediscovered them, the pandaren have begun spreading their monastic teachings. Monks are renowned for their skill in unarmed combat and rely on their fists and feet as much as their weapons. Healer monks are specialists in traditional medicine and often become spiritual leaders within their communities. A monk's primary attribute depends on their role : Agility for tanks and melee combatants, Intellect for healers.";
CLASS_MONK_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_monk:30:30|t  |cff00ff96Monk|r\nMonks of ancient Pandaria developed their martial arts as a means of resistance against their former masters. Now that the other peoples of Azeroth have rediscovered them, the pandaren have begun spreading their monastic teachings. Monks are renowned for their skill in unarmed combat and rely on their fists and feet as much as their weapons. Healer monks are specialists in traditional medicine and often become spiritual leaders within their communities. A monk's primary attribute depends on their role : Agility for tanks and melee combatants, Intellect for healers.";
CLASS_TAMER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_tamer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffffffffBeastmaster|r\nBeastmasters draw on their bond with the forces of nature to fight fiercely and control the beasts they have tamed.";
CLASS_TAMER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_tamer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffffffffBeastmaster|r\nBeastmasters draw on their bond with the forces of nature to fight fiercely and control the beasts they have tamed.";
CLASS_KNIGHT = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_knight_no_ui:30:30|t  |cfffadd16Knight|r\nKnights can wield any type of one- or two-handed weapon. They are formidable, highly resilient attackers. Loyal to a fault, they follow a code of honor that compels them to help the weak and their allies.";
CLASS_KNIGHT_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_knight_no_ui:30:30|t  |cfffadd16Knight|r\nKnights can wield any type of one- or two-handed weapon. They are formidable, highly resilient attackers. Loyal to a fault, they follow a code of honor that compels them to help the weak and their allies.";
CLASS_HERO = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_hero_no_ui:30:30|t  |cfffdc5b8Hero|r\nHeroes know no limits — they can learn any ability and forge their own destiny.";
CLASS_HERO_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_hero_no_ui:30:30|t  |cfffdc5b8Hero|r\nHeroes know no limits — they can learn any ability and forge their own destiny.";
CLASS_EVOKER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_evoker:30:30|t  |cff33937fEvoker|r\nDracthyr evokers were created to master the magic of the five dragonflights and seek to forge their own destiny in Azeroth. They can empower their draconic techniques with magic, charging their attacks and unleashing them at just the right moment for devastating effect. Their superior mobility also lets them move in and out of melee range with ease depending on the situation.";
CLASS_EVOKER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_evoker:30:30|t  |cff33937fEvoker|r\nDracthyr evokers were created to master the magic of the five dragonflights and seek to forge their own destiny in Azeroth. They can empower their draconic techniques with magic, charging their attacks and unleashing them at just the right moment for devastating effect. Their superior mobility also lets them move in and out of melee range with ease depending on the situation.";
CLASS_NECROMANCER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cff07c204Necromancer|r\nNecromancers are relentless commanders, masters of both life and death. These dark mages can raise the dead as skeletal soldiers, curse their enemies with devastating spells, and torment them further by hurling the corpses of their fallen comrades at them. Necromancers see life and death as part of a single whole, and they are not afraid to venture between the two. Drawing on their own life force, they wield their powerful abilities to win their battles. They care little for being at death's door, so long as no enemy is left standing to finish them off. Necromancers prefer to annihilate their opponents from a distance. The skeletons under their command overwhelm enemies before they even have a chance to attack, and the curses they employ can weaken even the most fearsome demons.";
CLASS_NECROMANCER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cff07c204Necromancer|r\nNecromancers are relentless commanders, masters of both life and death. These dark mages can raise the dead as skeletal soldiers, curse their enemies with devastating spells, and torment them further by hurling the corpses of their fallen comrades at them. Necromancers see life and death as part of a single whole, and they are not afraid to venture between the two. Drawing on their own life force, they wield their powerful abilities to win their battles. They care little for being at death's door, so long as no enemy is left standing to finish them off. Necromancers prefer to annihilate their opponents from a distance. The skeletons under their command overwhelm enemies before they even have a chance to attack, and the curses they employ can weaken even the most fearsome demons.";
CLASS_VENOMANCER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cfff57d20Venomancer|r\nA slow death awaits the Venomancer's opponents. To defend his territory, he plants countless venomous sentinels, then releases a thick, lingering cloud of poison to weaken his foes.";
CLASS_VENOMANCER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cfff57d20Venomancer|r\nA slow death awaits the Venomancer's opponents. To defend his territory, he plants countless venomous sentinels, then releases a thick, lingering cloud of poison to weaken his foes.";
CLASS_PYROMANCER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffff5204Pyromancer|r\nPyromancers are explosive and prefer to incinerate their enemies before they can even get close. With a wide array of interesting abilities, pyromancers use a number of spell combinations to maximize their effects. Pyromancers may choose to summon a phoenix companion to aid them, and thanks to their orb of flame, they can easily control and destroy large groups of enemies.";
CLASS_PYROMANCER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffff5204Pyromancer|r\nPyromancers are explosive and prefer to incinerate their enemies before they can even get close. With a wide array of interesting abilities, pyromancers use a number of spell combinations to maximize their effects. Pyromancers may choose to summon a phoenix companion to aid them, and thanks to their orb of flame, they can easily control and destroy large groups of enemies.";
CLASS_CHRONOMANCER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffa3bcbfChronomancer|r\nThe chronomancer is a manipulator of time and its forces, not its master. He simply understands the ebb and flow and can ride it as he pleases... to a certain extent. The ability to travel freely through time is a power no mortal possesses, although a chronomancer can visit the past as a spectral form and gain clues about possible futures. They form a rare, elite order of spellcasters, each seeing the others as allies in knowledge. Most are neutral. They see it as their personal mission to stop those who recklessly manipulate the flow of time and to rein in rogue chronomancers. They venture forth to gain knowledge of ancient civilizations and catch glimpses of what is to come. Chronomancers tend to be well versed in many subjects.";
CLASS_CHRONOMANCER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_mancer_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffa3bcbfChronomancer|r\nThe chronomancer is a manipulator of time and its forces, not its master. He simply understands the ebb and flow and can ride it as he pleases... to a certain extent. The ability to travel freely through time is a power no mortal possesses, although a chronomancer can visit the past as a spectral form and gain clues about possible futures. They form a rare, elite order of spellcasters, each seeing the others as allies in knowledge. Most are neutral. They see it as their personal mission to stop those who recklessly manipulate the flow of time and to rein in rogue chronomancers. They venture forth to gain knowledge of ancient civilizations and catch glimpses of what is to come. Chronomancers tend to be well versed in many subjects.";
CLASS_CHAOSRAVAGER = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_chaos_ravager_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffb79d44Chaos Ravager|r\nThe Chaos Ravager is a warrior consumed by the energies of chaos, unable to tell friend from foe on the battlefield. Wherever he goes, he leaves nothing but destruction and desolation. Wielding blades imbued with chaotic energy, he throws himself into melee with uncontrollable frenzy, breaking enemy lines and sowing terror in the enemy ranks. Some say he sold his soul to the forces of chaos in exchange for devastating power; others believe he has simply become the living embodiment of chaos itself.";
CLASS_CHAOSRAVAGER_FEMALE = "\n|TINTERFACE\\ICONS\\classicon_chaos_ravager_no_ui:30:30|t  |cffb79d44Chaos Ravager|r\nThe Chaos Ravager is a warrior consumed by the energies of chaos, unable to tell friend from foe on the battlefield. Wherever she goes, she leaves nothing but destruction and desolation. Wielding blades imbued with chaotic energy, she throws herself into melee with uncontrollable frenzy, breaking enemy lines and sowing terror in the enemy ranks. Some say she sold her soul to the forces of chaos in exchange for devastating power; others believe she has simply become the living embodiment of chaos itself.";
