RACE_INFO_KULTIRAN = "Kul Tiras was founded by intrepid explorers who braved unknown seas in search of adventure. Essential players in the Alliance of Lordaeron, the Kul Tirans once dominated the oceans of Azeroth with their legendary fleet. But after years of turmoil and hardship, the kingdom became isolated and fell prey to dark influences. With the help of valiant heroes, House Proudmoore has reclaimed its former glory, and the people of Kul Tiras are once again ready to fight alongside the Alliance.";
RACE_INFO_KULTIRAN_FEMALE = "Kul Tiras was founded by intrepid explorers who braved unknown seas in search of adventure. Essential players in the Alliance of Lordaeron, the Kul Tirans once dominated the oceans of Azeroth with their legendary fleet. But after years of turmoil and hardship, the kingdom became isolated and fell prey to dark influences. With the help of valiant heroes, House Proudmoore has reclaimed its former glory, and the people of Kul Tiras are once again ready to fight alongside the Alliance.";
RACE_INFO_MAGHAR = "Created by Neltharion the Earth-Warder, the essence of dragons was combined with the adaptability of mortal races to create an elite armed force able to shift between draconic and humanoid form. Long held in magical stasis, this army awakens to face a new threat on the Dragon Isles. It is in the Forbidden Reach that the adventure begins for dracthyr who wish to recover their memories before confronting a new reality.";
RACE_INFO_MAGHAR_FEMALE = "Created by Neltharion the Earth-Warder, the essence of dragons was combined with the adaptability of mortal races to create an elite armed force able to shift between draconic and humanoid form. Long held in magical stasis, this army awakens to face a new threat on the Dragon Isles. It is in the Forbidden Reach that the adventure begins for dracthyr who wish to recover their memories before confronting a new reality.";
